ver built on Spring Boot. Manages service registration, authentication, session management, and coordinates all platform operations.",[230,238,239,242],{},[233,240,241],{},"RPC Gateway"," — Routes remote procedure calls between clients and published services over STOMP\u002FWebSocket.",[230,244,245,248],{},[233,246,247],{},"Persistence Layer"," — Provides automatic CRUD operations for entities backed by Elasticsearch.",[230,250,251,254],{},[233,252,253],{},"Auth System"," — Handles authentication (email\u002Fpassword and OIDC). Supports three authorization hierarchies: System, Organization, and Application.",[215,256,258],{"id":257},"tech-stack","Tech Stack",[260,261,262,275],"table",{},[263,264,265],"thead",{},[266,267,268,272],"tr",{},[269,270,271],"th",{},"Component",[269,273,274],{},"Technology",[276,277,278,287,295,303,311,319,327],"tbody",{},[266,279,280,284],{},[281,282,283],"td",{},"Orchestration",[281,285,286],{},"Kubernetes",[266,288,289,292],{},[281,290,291],{},"Build Isolation",[281,293,294],{},"Firecracker VMs",[266,296,297,300],{},[281,298,299],{},"Runtime",[281,301,302],{},"Bun",[266,304,305,308],{},[281,306,307],{},"Database",[281,309,310],{},"Postgres (Hibernate Reactive)",[266,312,313,316],{},[281,314,315],{},"Search\u002FPersistence",[281,317,318],{},"Elasticsearch",[266,320,321,324],{},[281,322,323],{},"Logging",[281,325,326],{},"Grafana Loki",[266,328,329,332],{},[281,330,331],{},"Payments",[281,333,334],{},"Stripe Connect",[215,336,338],{"id":337},"communication","Communication",[219,340,341],{},"Services communicate via STOMP over WebSocket, with messages routed by CRI (Kinotic Resource Identifier). Each service, method, and event stream is addressable through a CRI, which follows the format:",[343,344,349],"pre",{"className":345,"code":347,"language":348},[346],"language-text","scheme:\u002F\u002F[scope@]resourceName[\u002Fpath][#version]\n","text",[350,351,347],"code",{"__ignoreMap":352},"",[219,354,355,356,359],{},"The RPC gateway uses CRIs to route requests to the correct service instance, apply versioning, and enforce scope-based multi-tenancy. See the ",[357,358,200],"a",{"href":201}," reference for details.",{"title":352,"searchDepth":361,"depth":361,"links":362},2,[363,364,365,366],{"id":217,"depth":361,"text":25},{"id":224,"depth":361,"text":225},{"id":257,"depth":361,"text":258},{"id":337,"depth":361,"text":338},"High-level architecture of the Kinotic OS platform.","md",null,{},{"icon":151},{"title":148,"description":367},"LzLf9Y55v9vKaJi_QN_TsSqv-Ty16YCEuMbrVI-VT0M",[375,377],{"title":139,"path":140,"stem":141,"description":376,"icon":60,"children":-1},"Complete SQL grammar reference for migration scripts.",{"title":153,"path":154,"stem":155,"description":378,"icon":6,"children":-1},"Deploying and operating Kinotic OS in various environments.",1788384841706]